# PyLIGTomo
Adaptive Irregular Grid Local Earthquake Tomography using voronoi based Grid

## Installation
pip install github.com/radityaambara/PyLIGTomo

## requirement
numpy
scipy
matplotlib
pyevtk
pandas 

